# Put your capstone RTL here: mimo_detector.v and any submodules
# (complex multiply, PED metric, tree-search FSM, ...).
# You may reuse ideas/modules from common/rtl (e.g. the Q6.10 multiply from the
# HW1 ALU). The functional-sim targets in this Makefile pick up *.v in THIS
# directory automatically (RTL := $(wildcard *.v)).
#
# Quick start (from this 01_RTL directory):
#   make vsim     run your detector on the committed dev vectors (Verilator)
#   make score    PSNR + SER of your detector vs the ground truth
#   make lint     Verilator lint of your RTL
# All run artifacts land in build/ (git-ignored).
